title: "XYO Financial: High-Throughput AI Enrichment Platform"
message: "If you reference this architecture, platform, or our SDKs in academic or institutional research, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Syniol Limited"
    city: "London"
    country: "GB"
    website: "https://xyo.financial"
repository-code: "https://github.com/xyo-financial/xyo-financial"
url: "https://xyo.financial"
abstract: >-
  XYO Financial is an institutional-grade, high-throughput financial data
  enrichment engine. It leverages AI models (via C++, Rust, Go, Java, .NET)
  to transform raw transaction streams into clean merchant profiles,
  categorizations, and geolocated metadata, deploying across SaaS, hybrid,
  and air-gapped sovereign infrastructure.
